    "short_description": {
      "html": "<p>A very strong espresso blend at an affordable price</p> <p>• 1 kg coffee beans</p> <p>• Dark-roasted Arabica and Robusta</p> <p>• Very strong (10/10)</p> <p>• Budget-friendly</p> <p>This Espresso Intenso is part of KaffeK&#039;s own budget line, offering good coffee at an affordable price. Made from dark-roasted Arabica and Robusta beans, it delivers a powerful, intense body with spicy notes and a long, satisfying finish. Despite its strength, it&#039;s easy to enjoy straight, and holds up just as well as a base for a cappuccino, flat white, or latte macchiato. Grind fresh before each use for the fullest flavour.</p> <p>Get yours today, only on KaffeK.</p>"
